@startuml
title 多人共享记账系统 - 用例图

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

actor 员工 as Employee
actor 老板 as Boss
actor 财务人员 as Finance

rectangle "多人共享记账系统" {

    usecase "登录系统" as UC_Login

    usecase "提交预算申请" as UC_SubmitBudget
    usecase "查看个人收支记录" as UC_ViewOwnRecords
    usecase "查看个人操作日志" as UC_ViewOwnLogs

    usecase "查看全部财务记录" as UC_ViewAllRecords
    usecase "查看全部操作日志" as UC_ViewAllLogs

    usecase "审批预算申请" as UC_ReviewBudget
    usecase "批准预算" as UC_ApproveBudget
    usecase "驳回预算" as UC_RejectBudget

    usecase "查看历史财务记录" as UC_History
    usecase "人工检查财务异常" as UC_InspectAnomaly
    usecase "向老板报告异常" as UC_ReportAnomaly
}

Employee --> UC_Login
Employee --> UC_SubmitBudget
Employee --> UC_ViewOwnRecords
Employee --> UC_ViewOwnLogs

Boss --> UC_Login
Boss --> UC_ViewAllRecords
Boss --> UC_ViewAllLogs
Boss --> UC_ReviewBudget

Finance --> UC_Login
Finance --> UC_ViewAllRecords
Finance --> UC_ViewAllLogs
Finance --> UC_History
Finance --> UC_InspectAnomaly
Finance --> UC_ReportAnomaly

UC_ReviewBudget ..> UC_ApproveBudget : <<include>>
UC_ReviewBudget ..> UC_RejectBudget : <<include>>

note right of UC_InspectAnomaly
  财务人员人工判断异常，
  不由系统自动作出结论。
end note

note bottom of UC_ViewAllRecords
  财务人员和老板可查看全部记录；
  员工只能查看个人记录。
end note

note bottom of UC_ReviewBudget
  预算申请由老板审批，
  财务人员不具有审批权限。
end note

@enduml